@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8099
@alphaApiKey = REPLACE_PRIVATELY_FROM_LOCAL_CREDENTIALS
@betaApiKey = REPLACE_PRIVATELY_FROM_LOCAL_CREDENTIALS
@productId = 1
@reservationId = 1

### Health, no key
GET {{baseUrl}}/healthz

### Contract, no key
GET {{baseUrl}}/openapi.json

### Initial inventory, use another SKU for another run
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/products
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"sku":"REST-DEMO-001","name":"Synthetic REST stock","onHand":1}

### Copy returned product ID above before continuing
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reservations
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-hold-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{"productId":{{productId}},"quantity":1,"ttlSeconds":300}

### Repeat preceding request unchanged to replay it
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/products/{{productId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}

### Foreign tenant gets 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{betaApiKey}}

### Copy returned reservation ID above before continuing
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-confirm-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Another held reservation can be cancelled using its ID and a fresh key
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/reservations/{{reservationId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}
Idempotency-Key: rest-cancel-0001
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Audit
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{alphaApiKey}}
